## **2. The ACE Flow Law (Conservation Principle)**

All ACE systems follow the same invariant:

\[
\text{Inflow} = \text{Outflow} + \Delta \text{Buffer}
\]

When the buffer is full or empty:

\[
\text{Inflow} = \text{Outflow}
\]

This applies equally to:

- CO₂e  
- money  
- liquidity  
- credit exposure  
- heat  
- air  
- grain  
- energy  

This is the **core structural law** that makes ACE cross‑domain.

